0..76 Comment "// A field is read by its label off the record a value is, whether a type is"
77..154 Comment "// written for the record or not: a definition\'s record, a field\'s record and"
155..231 Comment "// the record a run binds. A projection is a computation, so it stands where"
232..296 Comment "// one is read: a body, a bind, a run target, a path\'s endpoint."
